# The /audit hotspot screen. Run: vhs assets/tapes/audit.tape
Source assets/tapes/theme.tape
Output assets/audit.gif
Set Width 1500
Set Height 760

Hide
Type "source assets/tapes/setup.sh" Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Type "nib" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "/au"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "d"
Sleep 1s
Type "d"
Sleep 1.5s
Screenshot assets/audit.png
Sleep 1s
